OL,3,GNEWSAFirework noise 'control' needed to
OL,4,Aprotect animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FFarmers have called for better
OL,7,Fmanagement of private fireworks
OL,8,Fdisplays after their frightened cattle
OL,9,Fdamaged fences and injured themselves
OL,10,Fon barbed wire during past shows.
OL,12,FRoss Follett said he would use "the
OL,13,Fbest part of a day" to move 350 cows
OL,14,Finto a barn because he did not want to
OL,15,Frisk a repeat of his herd "running
OL,16,Fwild" and getting hurt.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
