OL,3,GNEWSAFirework noise 'control' needed to
OL,4,Aprotect animals
OL,5,
OL,6,FFollett said more needed to be done
OL,7,Fabout private fireworks, which comes as
OL,8,Fthe National Farmers' Union (NFU)
OL,9,Fcalled for tougher regulation, the
OL,10,Fdevelopment of quieter fireworks and
OL,11,Fadvance notice of displays.
OL,13,FA government spokesperson said it was
OL,14,Fassessing feedback to a consultation on
OL,15,Ffireworks.
